{"988530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Outrevenge", "steam_appid": 988530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Top-Down Cyberpunk Action-Adventure&quot;</h2><br>A High-Octane Fusion of Boomer Shooter and Top-Down Combat Action!<br><br>Get ready for adrenaline-pumping action inspired by classic 80's and 90's games and action films.<br>Lead a Military Special Missions Unit in a battle against deadly lifeforms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/extras/0e355c9c784361281ddec5cf65796af2.poster.avif?t=1784892721\" width=616 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/extras/0e355c9c784361281ddec5cf65796af2.webm?t=1784892721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/extras/0e355c9c784361281ddec5cf65796af2.mp4?t=1784892721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;A Forbidden World, Where Man Does Not Belong!&quot;</h2><br>Immerse yourself in a gripping top-down shooter that combines thrilling sci-fi firefights in bug infested hellscapes all the way to intense raw, jungle warfare.<br><br>The powerful mega-corporation operating on the giant space station Erena has resurrected life on the distant planet Zitatron-3. Erena is home to two distinct classes of humans: the privileged Citizens, who enjoy their lives in luxury, and the Workers, who live in grueling, prison-like conditions. These Workers dream of earning enough credits to elevate their families to citizenship and a better life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/extras/c7fe3841a3143c9a0f1bd8eb474f788f.poster.avif?t=1784892721\" width=617 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/extras/c7fe3841a3143c9a0f1bd8eb474f788f.webm?t=1784892721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br><strong>• Intense Combat:</strong> Engage in heart-pounding, fast-paced battles against swarms of alien creatures and hostile forces. Utilize a wide array of weapons and tactics to survive and dominate.<br><br><strong>• Rich Narrative:</strong> Unravel the story of a divided society on the brink of upheaval. Explore the harsh realities of life as a Worker and the opulence of Citizen life, and discover the dark secrets behind the corporation's resurrection of Zitatron-3.<br><br><strong>• Special game modes:</strong> Explore procedurally generated levels with your crew, or see how long you can survive the endless onslaught of alien insect hordes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/extras/e6a6dcd1b343eadb09b09c4bfe4fffda.poster.avif?t=1784892721\" width=617 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/extras/e6a6dcd1b343eadb09b09c4bfe4fffda.webm?t=1784892721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Top-Down Cyberpunk Action-Adventure&quot;</h2><br>A High-Octane Fusion of Boomer Shooter and Top-Down Combat Action!<br><br>Get ready for adrenaline-pumping action inspired by classic 80's and 90's games and action films.<br>Lead a Military Special Missions Unit in a battle against deadly lifeforms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988530/extras/0e3